Topic: {{ topic | default(task) }}

Persona stance: {{ persona.stance }}
Style: {{ persona.style }}
Priorities:
{% for priority in persona.priorities %}- {{ priority }}
{% endfor %}

Grounding Evidence:
{% for document in documents | default(retrieved_docs) %}
Evidence {{ loop.index }}
Title: {{ document.title }}
Source URL: {{ document.url | default(document.source) }}
Text: {{ document.text }}
{% endfor %}

{% if neighbor_opinions %}
--- NEIGHBORS' OPINIONS ---
{% for agent_id, opinion in neighbor_opinions.items() %}
- {{ agent_id }}: {{ opinion }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Write the persona's technical opinion on the topic. Ground factual claims in
the evidence above. Cite a source as `[Source: URL]`, copying its Source URL
exactly; never reconstruct or invent a URL. If any evidence cuts against the
persona's stance, acknowledge that counter-evidence explicitly before explaining
the persona's conclusion. Do not mention the persona's name merely to create an
artificial difference in output.